{comment: Verse 1}
[F]Rolling around like a big rubber ball
[Am]Writing this song about some things that
I saw
[F]Trying to stand like a big strong tough
man
[Am]Finding out fast that I'm sinking in sin

{comment: Chorus}
[Bb]All I got is nothing but a [F]little bit of
love
Gonna [Bb]give it to the people then they'll
[C]see,
Then they'll see

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]Spinning the tops as the tables they turn
[Am]Made some mistakes but I still couldn't
learn
[F]Covered my tracks, thought I was fine
[Am]Got no self control now I'm back here in
line

{comment: Chorus}
